{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"cannot_tell\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"cannot_tell\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"DOI:10.1101/2025.01.10.632393 | Subthalamic Signature of Freezing of Gait in Parkinson’s Disease (2025)\",\n    \"preprint (which was not certified by peer review) is the author/funder. All rights reserved. No reuse allowed without permission.\",\n    \"The copyright holder for thisthis version posted January 11, 2025. ; https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.01.10.632393doi: bioRxiv preprint\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"preprint (which was not certified by peer review) is the author/funder. All rights reserved. No reuse allowed without permission.\",\n    \"The copyright holder for thisthis version posted January 11, 2025. ; https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.01.10.632393doi: bioRxiv preprint\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两项均判定为cannot_tell。第一，全文能够确认研究的题目、bioRxiv预印本DOI及2025年1月11日的版本发布时间，但没有提及报告的结构化附录、version_of字段、报告第2.4节，也没有出现PMID:23225012或PMID:40709562。因此，无法仅凭论文全文确认报告是否填写了这两个PMID，也无法判断报告正文与附录是否存在版本映射矛盾。第二，全文没有提及Mhyre等人2012年的Parkinson's disease综述章节、DOI:10.1007/978-94-007-5416-4_16，也没有说明PMID:23225012对应的文献是什么，更没有明确给出本研究正式发表版本的PMID。因此，无法仅凭全文验证指控者关于PMID:23225012实际文献身份及其并非本研究正式发表版本的描述。需要特别区分：全文没有提供相关信息，不等于全文否定了报告或指控者的说法。论文明确标注为未经同行评审的bioRxiv预印本，但这不足以判定两个PMID的版本映射。故不能认定报告读错，也不能认定指控者的文献身份描述已得到全文支持。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "259b51ff-4d8c-4662-98d2-1f4a2c4fe5f7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T200659906867Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T20:07:34.542555+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "co